-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a weekly dinner plan for a family of 4 with picky eaters"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can help you create a weekly dinner plan for your family of 4! To make sure it suits your picky eaters, how about we try some universally loved and often kid-friendly options? Here’s a proposal for a dinner plan for the upcoming week. Please let me know if these sound good, or if you''d like to swap any dishes out!\n\n**Proposed Weekly Dinner Plan (starting tomorrow, Saturday, November 15th, 2025):**\n\n*   **Saturday:** Homemade Pizza (everyone can customize their own toppings!)\n*   **Sunday:** Roast Chicken with Mashed Potatoes (classic comfort food)\n*   **Monday:** Spaghetti and Meatballs (a guaranteed hit)\n*   **Tuesday:** Tacos (build-your-own style for fun and choice)\n*   **Wednesday:** Chicken Nuggets with Sweet Potato Fries (a kid-favorite)\n*   **Thursday:** Macaroni and Cheese with hidden veggies (creamy and familiar)\n*   **Friday:** Fish and Chips (a treat to end the week)\n\nWhat do you think of this plan? Should I go ahead and create it, or would you like to make any changes?"}]}]',1763113599698,1763113599698,'**User''s core intent**: The user wants the AI to create a weekly dinner plan for a family of four with picky eaters.\u000a**Key actions made**: The AI generated a 7-day dinner plan proposal, featuring universally loved and kid-friendly dishes tailored for picky eaters.\u000a**Current state**: The AI has presented a specific dinner plan proposal and is awaiting user feedback to either proceed with it or make modifications.');
