:30,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Cook macaroni according to package directions. Drain.;2. In a saucepan, melt butter. Whisk in flour and cook for 1 minute.;3. Gradually whisk in milk until smooth. Cook, stirring, until thickened.;4. Remove from heat. Stir in cheese, pureed veggies, salt, and pepper until cheese is melted and sauce is smooth.;5. Combine with cooked macaroni.\",\"ingredients\":\"elbow macaroni: box 1 , is_optional: ;butter: cup 0.25 , is_optional: ;flour: cup 0.25 , is_optional: ;milk: cups 3 , is_optional: ;shredded cheddar cheese: cups 2 , is_optional: ;pureed butternut squash or carrots: cup 0.5 , is_optional: ;salt: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;black pepper: tsp 0.25 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":1},{\"id\":\"da9eae9b-7062-454a-b84a-d39d432011b4\",\"name\":\"Sweet Potato Fries\",\"cooking_time\":35,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).;2. Peel and cut sweet potatoes into fry shapes.;3. Toss with olive oil, salt, and paprika.;4. Spread in a single layer on a baking sheet.;5. Bake for 20-25 minutes, flipping halfway, until crispy.\",\"ingredients\":\"large sweet potatoes:  2 , is_optional: ;olive oil: tbsp 1 , is_optional: ;salt: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;paprika: tsp 0.25 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":1},{\"id\":\"53ea069f-4eb9-4ccc-9b5d-0f1273556cff\",\"name\":\"Homemade Chicken Nuggets\",\"cooking_time\":30,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Cut chicken breast into bite-sized pieces.;2. Set up a breading station: one bowl with flour, one with beaten eggs, one with breadcrumbs seasoned with salt and pepper.;3. Dredge chicken pieces in flour, then egg, then breadcrumbs.;4. Fry in oil at 350°F (175°C) until golden brown and cooked through, or bake at 400°F (200°C) for 20-25 minutes.\",\"ingredients\":\"boneless, skinless chicken breast: lb 1 , is_optional: ;breadcrumbs: cup 1 , is_optional: ;flour: cup 0.5 , is_optional: ;eggs:  2 , is_optional: ;salt: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;black pepper: tsp 0.25 , 