764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Recipes using eggs, tomatoes, and onions"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking for recipes with eggs, tomatoes, and onions..."},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"Acz4UohONLUXpUli","name":"recipe_searchRecipes","arguments":{"query":"eggs tomatoes onions"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"recipe_searchRecipes","content":"[{\"id\":\"bcce47be-2223-4c34-a4f6-39b17502887f\",\"name\":\"Scrambled Eggs with Tomatoes\",\"cooking_time\":15,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Chop tomatoes and beat eggs;2. Heat oil and cook tomatoes first;3. Add eggs and scramble together;4. Season with salt and serve\",\"ingredients\":\"eggs:  3 , is_optional: ;tomatoes: g 300 , is_optional: ;oil: tablespoon 1 , is_optional: ;salt:   , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"6feb1ea9-4351-4be4-b2d4-894ec5d09156\",\"name\":\"Scrambled Eggs with Tomatoes\",\"cooking_time\":10,\"servings\":3,\"instructions\":\"1. Dice 3 medium tomatoes;2. Beat 4 eggs with salt and pepper;3. Heat 2 tablespoons oil in wok over medium-high heat;4. Pour in eggs and scramble until just set, then remove;5. Add 1 tablespoon oil and stir-fry tomatoes for 2 minutes;6. Return eggs to pan and toss together;7. Add 1 tablespoon sugar and 1 tablespoon soy sauce, then serve\",\"ingredients\":\"medium tomatoes:  3 , is_optional: ;eggs:  4 , is_optional: ;oil: tablespoons 2 , is_optional: ;sugar: tablespoon 1 , is_optional: ;soy sauce: tablespoon 1 , is_optional: ;salt:   , is_optional: ;pepper:   , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-c6a4762f-0dc9-4998-bc89-09ee90ddedb3\",\"name\":\"Eggplant with Tomatoes\",\"cooking_time\":15,\"servings\":1,\"instructions\":\"1. Brown the eggplant in butter.;2. Add salt and pepper to the eggplant.;3. Heat canned tomatoes in a separate pan.;4. Pour the heated tomatoes over the eggplant.;5. Sprinkle with chopped chives.\",\"ingredients\":\"Eggplant: slice 2 , is_optional: ;Butter: tsp 2 , is_optional: ;Canned tomatoes: cup 0.25 , is_optional: ;Chives: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;Salt:  0 , is_optional: is optional;Pepper:  0 , is_optional: is optional\",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"1b70e412-9e56-434e-9210-e12a2a8d8f39\",\"name\":\"Tomato and Egg Soup\",\"cooking_time\":12,\"servings\":3,\"instructions\":\"1. Dice 3 medium tomatoes;2. Bring 4 cups chicken broth to boil;3. Add tomatoes and simmer 3 minutes;4. Beat 2 eggs and slowly pour into broth;5. Season with salt and serve hot\",\"ingredients\":\"medium tomatoes:  3 , is_optional: ;chicken broth: cups 4 , is_optional: ;eggs:  2 , is_optional: ;salt:   , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-bfeb364c-524a-4d18-bcff-e2f93905e7c7\",\"name\":\"Eggplant and Tomato Salad\",\"cooking_time\":40,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Wipe the eggplants but do not peel them.;2. Place eggplants on a baking sheet and bake at 450°F (230°C) for 20 minutes, until their skins burst.;3. Peel the skins off the baked eggplants and beat the pulp in a basin until smooth.;4. Skin the tomatoes and remove their seeds.;5. Chop the tomato flesh roughly.;6. Arrange the chopped tomatoes in a layer on top of the eggplant pulp.;7. In a separate bowl, mix together the olive oil, lemon juice, salt, and pepper.;8. Pour this dressing over the eggplant and tomato salad.;9. Just before serving, toss the salad well and sprinkle with the chopped chives.\",\"ingredients\":\"Eggplants:  4 , is_optional: ;Tomatoes:  5 , is_optional: ;Olive oil: tbsp 4 , is_optional: ;Lemon juice: tbsp 2 , is_optional: ;Salt:   , is_optional: ;Pepper:   , is_optional: ;Fresh chives: tsp 2 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"68d93a18-74f6-4716-80b5-fcdcd0824794\",\"name\":\"Tomato and Egg Soup\",\"cooking_time\":15,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Bring broth to boil;2. Add diced tomatoes;3. Drizzle beaten eggs into soup;4. Season and serve hot\",\"ingredients\":\"chicken broth: cups 4 , is_optional: ;tomatoes: g 300 , is_optional: ;eggs:  2 , is_optional: ;salt to taste:   , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-042eca05-53e2-4012-bc89-922e95bbca21\",\"name\":\"Eggplant and Tomatoes\",\"cooking_time\":40,\"servings\":2,\"instructions\":\"1. Wash and slice the aubergines (eggplant).;2. Heat ghee in a pot. When hot, sauté the finely chopped onion and sliced garlic for 2 to 3 minutes.;3. Add turmeric, bay leaf, and cinnamon stick and sauté for a further 2 minutes, stirring frequently.;4. Stir in the sliced eggplant.;5. Add salt, cayenne pepper, and ginger.;6. Blend together well.;7. Cook for 10 minutes.;8. Add the tomatoes, cover the pot, and cook for another 10 minutes.;9. Sprinkle with garam masala and serve.\",\"ingredients\":\"Eggplant: lb 0.5 , is_optional: ;Ghee: tbsp 2 , is_optional: ;Onion:  1 , is_optional: ;Garlic cloves:  1 , is_optional: ;Turmeric: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;Bay leaf:  1 , is_optional: ;Cinnamon stick:  1 , is_optional: ;Salt: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;Cayenne pepper: tsp 0.75 , is_optional: ;Fresh ginger: slice 1 , is_optional: ;Tomatoes:  2 , is_optional: ;Garam masala: tsp 1 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-d6964e0d-8178-494a-a674-b7c00eeed8c9\",\"name\":\"Cream Cheese Tomato Omelet\",\"cooking_time\":20,\"servings\":2,\"instructions\":\"1. Beat eggs until light, then beat in cream, salt, and pepper.;2. Melt butter in a large skillet.;3. Pour eggs into skillet.;4. When eggs are set but still soft, spread tomatoes and cream cheese over top.;5. Fold the omelet in half.;6. When the bottom is brown, flip over and brown the other side.\",\"ingredients\":\"eggs:  6 , is_optional: ;cream: cup 0.25 , is_optional: ;salt:   , is_optional: ;black pepper:   , is_optional: ;butter: cup 0.25 , is_optional: ;cream cheese: oz 6 , is_optional: ;fresh tomatoes:  2 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-75e35c87-cfbf-4792-b202-1f9ca0eadc99\",\"name\":\"Poached Eggs in Tomato Sauce\",\"cooking_time\":45,\"servings\":8,\"instructions\":\"1. Heat oil in a large, deep skillet.;2. Add thinly sliced onions to the skillet and cook until tender but not browned.;3. Place canned whole tomatoes in a blender or food processor and blend until chopped but not pureed.;4. Add the chopped tomatoes and green chiles to the onion mixture in the skillet and cook for 5 minutes.;5. Add water, salt, sugar, and black pepper to the skillet and cook for 5 minutes longer.;6. Break each egg, one at a time, onto a small plate and carefully slide into the hot water mixture in the skillet, being careful not to break the yolk.;7. Arrange one slice of Monterey Jack cheese on top of each egg.;8. Cover the skillet and cook gently for 5 to 8 minutes, or until the eggs are set and the cheese is melted.\",\"ingredients\":\"Oil: cup 0.33 , is_optional: ;Onions:  2 , is_optional: ;Canned whole tomatoes: lb 2 , is_optional: ;Canned whole green chiles: oz 7 , is_optional: ;Water: cup 2 , is_optional: ;Salt: tsp 1 , is_optional: ;Sugar: tsp 0.5 , is_optional: ;Black pepper: tsp 0.125 , is_optional: ;Eggs:  8 , is_optional: ;Monterey Jack cheese: oz 3 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-4afa4302-9d65-463a-ae1b-d874389c306d\",\"name\":\"Eggs with Peppers and Tomato Cream\",\"cooking_time\":45,\"servings\":8,\"instructions\":\"1. Heat 1 tablespoon of the olive oil in a medium skillet, preferably non-stick. Add onion; cook over medium heat until it begins to soften, 3 to 4 minutes. Add bell peppers and garlic; cook 2 minutes. Add vinegar, salt and pepper. Reduce to low heat and cook until vegetables are soft, 4 to 5 minutes. Remove from heat and add basil.;2. Meanwhile, brush the Italian bread with the remaining olive oil. Arrange on a baking sheet and bake in a 400-degree oven until lightly browned, 4 to 5 minutes; set aside.;3. Combine marinara sauce and cream in a small saucepan or in a microwave-safe dish; cook until heated through.;4. To serve, divide the vegetable mixture over toasted bread slices. Top each with a poached egg and marinara sauce. Sprinkle grated Parmesan cheese over and serve at once.\",\"ingredients\":\"Italian bread: slice 8 , is_optional: ;Olive oil: cup 0.33 , is_optional: ;Onion:  1 , is_optional: ;Red pepper:  1 , is_optional: ;Yellow pepper:  1 , is_optional: ;Garlic: clove 1 , is_optional: ;Balsamic vinegar: tsp 2.5 , is_optional: ;Salt:   , is_optional: is optional;Ground pepper:   , is_optional: is optional;Fresh basil: tbsp 2 , is_optional: ;Marinara sauce: cup 1.5 , is_optional: ;Whipping cream: cup 0.5 , is_optional: ;Poached eggs:  8 , is_optional: ;Parmesan cheese: cup 0.33 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0}]","success":true,"tool_call_id":"Acz4UohONLUXpUli"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are a few recipes that use eggs, tomatoes, and onions:\n\n*   **Poached Eggs in Tomato Sauce** (45 minutes, 8 servings)\n    *   Ingredients include: Onions, Canned whole tomatoes, Eggs\n    *   Instructions involve cooking thinly sliced onions, adding blended tomatoes and green chiles, then poaching eggs in the sauce.\n\n*   **Eggs with Peppers and Tomato Cream** (45 minutes, 8 servings)\n    *   Ingredients include: Onion, Red pepper, Yellow pepper, Garlic, Fresh basil, Marinara sauce, Poached eggs\n    *   Instructions involve cooking onions and peppers, then serving with poached eggs and a tomato cream sauce.\n\nDo any of these sound good to you?"}]}]',1763125419961,1763125419961,'-   **User''s core intent**: The user wants recipes that include eggs, tomatoes, and onions.\u000a-   **Key actions made**: The AI provided two recipe options: "Poached Eggs in Tomato Sauce" and "Eggs with Peppers and Tomato Cream", detailing ingredients and brief instructions for each.\u000a-   **Current state**: The AI is awaiting user feedback on the provided recipe options to see if either sounds good.');
