ption":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Please find some low-sugar desserts online and add them to my Recipes."}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I''ll search for some delicious low-sugar dessert recipes online for you. Please give me a moment."},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"BN1UYALXSicRs6Zm","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"low-sugar dessert recipes"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here are some **low-sugar dessert recipe ideas** based on diverse, healthy, and diabetes-friendly options:\\n\\n- **Olive Oil Banana Cake**: Made with whole wheat pastry flour and bananas for natural sweetness and fiber. Uses olive oil for heart-healthy fats and includes no added refined sugar.\\n\\n- **Chocolate Zucchini Bread**: Uses shredded zucchini for moisture and nutrients, cocoa powder, and semi-sweet chocolate chips for flavor; naturally lower in sugar and rich in antioxidants.\\n\\n- **Peanut Butter Cocoa Fudge**: Combines natural peanut butter and cocoa with minimal maple syrup for sweetness, offering healthy fats with low sugar content.\\n\\n- **Avocado Mousse**: Creamy and sweetened with maple syrup and cinnamon, this mousse uses avocado for heart-healthy fats and keeps sugar low.\\n\\n- **Flourless Chickpea White Chocolate Blondies**: Chickpeas add fiber and protein, creating a low-carb, low-sugar dessert suitable for diabetes-friendly diets.\\n\\n- **Lemon Tofu Crème**: A protein-rich, creamy, and low-carb dessert with minimal sugar, ideal for those managing blood sugar.\\n\\n- **No-Bake Energy Bites**: Recipes like chocolate chip or caramel date energy bites use natural, wholesome ingredients, are low in added sugars, and are heart-healthy.\\n\\n- **Blueberry Sweet Corn Frozen Greek Yogurt Bark**: A low-carb, low-sugar frozen treat using Greek yogurt and fresh fruit.\\n\\n- **Raw Oatmeal Cookie Energy Bites**: Made with oatmeal for fiber that helps stabilizing blood sugar, naturally low in sugar, and filling.\\n\\n- **Chocolate Peanut Butter Snack Bars**: Grain-free and gluten-free bars that use natural ingredients and limited sugar for a balanced sweet treat.\\n\\n- **Healthy Hot Chocolate Date Bites**: Made with dates, oats, hazelnuts, and unsweetened cocoa, coated with dark chocolate without sugar, these treats offer natural sweetness with low sugar.\\n\\nMany of these desserts rely on **natural sweeteners like ripe bananas, dates, maple syrup, or fresh fruit**, avoid refined sugars, and incorporate ingredients beneficial for heart health, diabetes, and blood sugar management.\\n\\nIf you want specific recipes for any of these desserts, I can provide step-by-step instructions.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"BN1UYALXSicRs6Zm"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found several low-sugar dessert ideas for you! They include:\n\n- Olive Oil Banana Cake\n- Chocolate Zucchini Bread\n- Peanut Butter Cocoa Fudge\n- Avocado Mousse\n- Flourless Chickpea White Chocolate Blondies\n- Lemon Tofu Crème\n- No-Bake Energy Bites\n- Blueberry Sweet Corn Frozen Greek Yogurt Bark\n- Raw Oatmeal Cookie Energy Bites\n- Chocolate Peanut Butter Snack Bars\n- Healthy Hot Chocolate Date Bites\n\nWhich of these would you like me to add to your cookbook? Or would you like me to search for details on a specific one?"}]}]',1763127785156,1763127785156,'**User''s core intent**: The user wants to add low-sugar dessert recipes to their cookbook, specifically asking the AI to find these recipes online.\u000a**Key actions made**: The user requested recipes. The AI performed a search for low-sugar dessert recipes online.\u000a**Current state**: The AI has provided a list of low-sugar dessert recipe ideas found online and is awaiting the user''s selection or further instruction on which to add or detail.');
