ppointment** - Due by March 1st, 2026\n   Contact and schedule an appointment with your CPA\n\n✅ **File taxes** - Due by April 1st, 2026\n   Complete and file your annual tax return\n\nAll tasks have been added to your task list with staggered due dates to help you stay organized throughout the tax preparation process!"}]}]',1763015998106,1763017912941,'**User''s core intent**: \u000aCreate a multi-step Annual Tax Preparation task with four subtasks broken down by specific deadlines to organize the tax filing process from January through April.\u000a\u000a**Key Items**: \u000a- Gather W2s and 1099s, ID: [uuid not provided], Due January 31st - collect income documents\u000a- Organize receipts by category, ID: [uuid not provided], Due February 15th - categorize deductible expenses\u000a- Schedule CPA appointment, ID: [uuid not provided], Due March 1st - arrange professional consultation\u000a- File taxes, ID: [uuid not provided], Due April 1st - submit annual tax return\u000a\u000a**Current state**: \u000aAll four subtasks have been successfully created and added to the user''s task list with staggered due dates to support organized tax preparation workflow.');
