c-9070-4814-849b-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I want to make Chinese tonight, any suggestions from the internet?"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can help with that! Let me search the internet for some Chinese food suggestions for tonight."},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"3CCPEqe4PAR4c1iq","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"Chinese food suggestions"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"For Chinese food suggestions, you can explore a wide range of popular dishes from both traditional and Americanized Chinese cuisine, depending on your taste preferences.\\n\\nSome widely loved Chinese-American dishes include **Orange Chicken**, **Kung Pao Chicken**, **Beef and Broccoli**, **Bang Bang Shrimp**, **Szechuan Beef**, and **Shrimp Toasts**. These dishes often balance sweet, salty, and spicy flavors and are commonly enjoyed as takeout or home-cooked meals.\\n\\nIf you prefer authentic regional Chinese flavors, consider trying dishes like **Mapo Tofu** (a spicy Sichuan tofu with numbing peppercorns), **Spicy Pork Hand-Pulled Noodles**, **Sichuan Dan Dan Noodles**, **Prawn Dumplings in Red Oil**, or **Sichuan Bang Bang Chicken Noodles** for a more intense and traditional experience.\\n\\nOther classic options include Cantonese-inspired dishes such as **Char Siu BBQ Pork** and various **Double Boiled Soups**, as well as street food like **Jianbing** (a savory Chinese crepe).\\n\\nFor beginners, you might enjoy recipes that are easier to prepare like **Taiwanese Three Cup Chicken**, **Hakka Style Rolled Omelette**, or **Lo Mein Noodles**.\\n\\nIn addition, some of the top popular Chinese dishes in America include **Crab Rangoon**, **General Tso’s Chicken**, **Wonton Soup**, **Sweet and Sour Chicken**, **Fried Rice**, **Egg Rolls**, **Pot Stickers**, and **Chow Mein**.\\n\\nThese suggestions cover a good balance of spicy, savory, sweet, and umami flavors across various Chinese food styles and regional specialties. Let me know if you want recipes or details about any specific dish!\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"3CCPEqe4PAR4c1iq"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found some great Chinese food suggestions for you! \n\nFor popular Chinese-American dishes, you might enjoy **Orange Chicken**, **Kung Pao Chicken**, **Beef and Broccoli**, **Bang Bang Shrimp**, or **Szechuan Beef**. \n\nIf you''re looking for more authentic regional flavors, consider **Mapo Tofu**, **Spicy Pork Hand-Pulled Noodles**, **Sichuan Dan Dan Noodles**, or **Prawn Dumplings in Red Oil**.\n\nSome other classic and popular options include **Char Siu BBQ Pork**, **Wonton Soup**, **Sweet and Sour Chicken**, **Fried Rice**, and **Pot Stickers**.\n\nDo any of these sound good, or would you like me to find recipes for a specific dish?"}]}]',1763437170887,1763437170887,'**User''s core intent**: The user wants suggestions for Chinese food recipes to make tonight, based on internet searches.\u000a**Key actions made**: The AI searched the internet and provided a list of various Chinese dish suggestions, categorized by popular Chinese-American, authentic regional, and classic options.\u000a**Current state**: The AI has offered several suggestions and is now awaiting the user''s feedback or selection to provide specific recipes.');
