,"name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Creative ways to use leftover turkey"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"toolu_01QaFBYrp6iy8DFssc7VXdy6","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"creative leftover turkey recipes ideas"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here are several **creative leftover turkey recipe ideas** beyond the traditional sandwich:\\n\\n- **Leftover Turkey Pot Pie Gratin:** Reinvents the classic pot pie by layering a creamy turkey and vegetable filling topped with thinly sliced potatoes and Gruyere cheese, baked until golden and bubbly. It’s a comforting, protein-rich dish that transforms leftover turkey and veggies into something new.\\n\\n- **BBQ Turkey Flatbread:** Use premade pizza dough topped with BBQ sauce, leftover turkey, and cheese for a quick and flavorful flatbread pizza-style meal.\\n\\n- **Turkey Tortilla Soup:** A simple and light soup made with turkey, salsa, chicken broth, zucchini, and lime, topped with sour cream, cheddar, and avocado for garnish.\\n\\n- **Turkey Chili:** Hearty and spiced chili using leftover turkey instead of ground meat; great for an easy, pantry-friendly meal.\\n\\n- **Turkey Panini:** A grilled sandwich with turkey and cheese—easy to customize with any bread you have on hand.\\n\\n- **Turkey Pasta Salad:** Mix turkey with rigatoni, vegetables, fresh herbs, vinaigrette, pine nuts, and bacon for a flavorful cold pasta salad.\\n\\n- **Turkey Bolognese:** Simmer shredded turkey with jarred marinara and herbs to create a quick pasta sauce alternative.\\n\\n- **Leftover Turkey Soup with Giant Couscous:** A comforting homemade soup combining turkey, vegetables, turkey stock, and Israeli couscous (or regular noodles) for a filling meal.\\n\\n- **Turkey Pomegranate Salad Sandwiches:** A fresh twist on turkey sandwiches using pomegranate for added sweetness and texture.\\n\\n- **Turkey Pho:** Substitute turkey for chicken in a traditional Vietnamese pho broth with noodles and herbs.\\n\\n- **Cheddar Turkey Casserole:** A cheesy baked casserole with spiral noodles, frozen veggies, spices, and turkey—perfect for a cozy family dinner.\\n\\n- **Turkey Frittata:** Incorporate turkey into an egg-based dish for a protein-packed breakfast or brunch.\\n\\nThese recipes demonstrate how versatile leftover turkey can be used across soups, casseroles, salads, flatbreads, and more, helping you avoid meal fatigue after holidays.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"toolu_01QaFBYrp6iy8DFssc7VXdy6"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Oh, what a fun question! 🍗 Here are some super creative ways to transform that leftover turkey into delicious dishes:\n\n**Light & Fresh Options:**\n- **Turkey Tortilla Soup** - Tangy, fresh, and perfect for using up that turkey with salsa, broth, and all the fun toppings\n- **Turkey Pomegranate Salad Sandwiches** - Sweet pomegranate adds a nice twist to traditional turkey sandwiches\n- **Turkey Pasta Salad** - Toss with rigatoni, veggies, and vinaigrette for a cold meal that''s easy to prep ahead\n\n**Comfort Foods:**\n- **Turkey Pot Pie Gratin** - Creamy turkey and veggies with a golden potato and cheese topping—so cozy!\n- **Cheddar Turkey Casserole** - Cheesy, baked, and perfect for the whole family\n- **Turkey Bolognese** - Quick pasta sauce that''s different from the usual\n\n**Quick & Easy Weeknight Meals:**\n- **BBQ Turkey Flatbread** - Use store-bought pizza dough + BBQ sauce + cheese for dinner in minutes\n- **Turkey Panini** - Grilled and melty—basically turkey sandwich''s fancy cousin\n- **Turkey Chili** - Hearty, spiced, and perfect for meal prep\n\n**Global Flavors:**\n- **Turkey Pho** - Vietnamese-inspired with noodles and aromatic broth\n- **Turkey Frittata** - Breakfast or brunch with protein-packed eggs\n\n**Soups & Warm Meals:**\n- **Leftover Turkey Soup with Couscous** - Ultimate comfort in a bowl\n\nWould you like me to create a specific recipe for any of these? I can make them ready for your meal plan! 😊"}]}]',1763450936965,1763450936965,'**User''s core intent**: The user wants creative ideas for using leftover turkey.\u000a**Key actions made**: The AI provided a categorized list of 13 creative recipe ideas for leftover turkey, including light options, comfort foods, quick meals, and global flavors.\u000a**Current state**: The AI has offered to create specific recipes for any of the suggested ideas, ready for the user''s meal plan.');
