me":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"15-minute Asian-inspired dinners"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Oh, that sounds delicious! I''ll look up some speedy and yummy Asian-inspired dinner ideas for you. Just a moment!"},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"caXnyv4Y2YCPZYT8","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"15-minute Asian-inspired dinners"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here are some delicious and easy 15-minute Asian-inspired dinner ideas, perfect for busy weeknights or when you want a quick, flavorful meal:\\n\\n### Quick 15-Minute Asian-Inspired Dinners\\n\\n#### 1. **Thai Stir-Fried Noodles (Pad See Ew)**\\n- Classic Thai street food made with wide rice noodles, soy sauce, and vegetables.\\n- Ready in 15 minutes and tastes better than takeout.\\n\\n#### 2. **Thai Chilli Basil Chicken Stir Fry**\\n- Ground or diced chicken stir-fried with garlic, chilli, and basil.\\n- Substitute Thai basil with regular basil if needed.\\n\\n#### 3. **Chinese Chicken and Corn Soup**\\n- A comforting Chinese classic, ready in minutes with canned corn and chicken.\\n\\n#### 4. **Spicy Thai Noodles (Pad Kee Mao / Drunken Noodles)**\\n- Spicy, salty, and savory Thai street food with rice noodles, vegetables, and a punchy sauce.\\n\\n#### 5. **Mapo Tofu (Japanese Version)**\\n- Quick and less oily than the Sichuan original, but still packed with flavor.\\n\\n#### 6. **Crunchy Asian Chicken Salad**\\n- A fresh, healthy salad with an Asian-inspired dressing.\\n\\n#### 7. **Soba with Green Beans and Beef**\\n- Soba noodles with thinly sliced beef and green beans, tossed in a smooth dressing.\\n\\n#### 8. **Stir-Fried Green Beans with Pork or Beef Mince**\\n- A classic Japanese-style stir fry with intense flavor.\\n\\n#### 9. **Korean Beef Bowl (Quick Bulgogi)**\\n- Thinly sliced beef with a sweet and savory marinade, served over rice.\\n\\n#### 10. **Thai Coconut Chicken Soup (Tom Kha Gai)**\\n- Creamy, fragrant soup with coconut milk, chicken, and fresh herbs.\\n\\n#### 11. **Sweet and Spicy Hoisin Cashew Chicken**\\n- Chicken stir-fried with hoisin sauce and cashews.\\n\\n#### 12. **Pork and Chive Moneybags**\\n- Quick dumplings filled with pork and chives.\\n\\n#### 13. **Korean Bulgogi Beef Bowl**\\n- Marinated beef with vegetables, served over rice.\\n\\n#### 14. **Garlic Butter Prawns with Soy Sauce**\\n- Succulent prawns cooked in garlic butter and soy sauce.\\n\\n#### 15. **Oyster Chicken with Basil**\\n- Chicken stir-fried with oyster sauce and fresh basil.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Tips for 15-Minute Asian Dinners\\n- Use pre-cooked or frozen ingredients (like rice, noodles, or pre-cut vegetables) to save time.\\n- Keep a well-stocked pantry with soy sauce, oyster sauce, hoisin sauce, sesame oil, and rice vinegar.\\n- Prep ingredients ahead of time for even faster cooking.\\n\\nThese recipes are perfect for a quick, satisfying meal that brings bold Asian flavors to your table in no time!\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"caXnyv4Y2YCPZYT8"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found some fantastic 15-minute Asian-inspired dinner ideas for you! How about:\n\n*   **Thai Stir-Fried Noodles (Pad See Ew)**\n*   **Thai Chilli Basil Chicken Stir Fry**\n*   **Chinese Chicken and Corn Soup**\n*   **Spicy Thai Noodles (Pad Kee Mao / Drunken Noodles)**\n*   **Mapo Tofu (Japanese Version)**\n*   **Crunchy Asian Chicken Salad**\n*   **Soba with Green Beans and Beef**\n*   **Stir-Fried Green Beans with Pork or Beef Mince**\n*   **Korean Beef Bowl (Quick Bulgogi)**\n*   **Thai Coconut Chicken Soup (Tom Kha Gai)**\n\nDo any of these catch your eye, or would you like to hear more options? 😊"}]}]',1763972024943,1763972024943,replace('- **User''s core intent**: The user wants suggestions for "15-minute Asian-inspired dinners."\n- **Key actions made**: The AI acknowledged the request, used a tool to find options, and presented a list of ten specific Asian-inspired dinner ideas.\n- **Current state**: The AI has provided multiple dinner options and is waiting for the user to select one or request more alternatives.','\n',char(10)));
