;Maple syrup: tsp 2 , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-8aed4ac4-ead8-4df2-88cd-75b703d7b1a4\",\"name\":\"Tofu French Toast\",\"cooking_time\":20,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Put the tofu, water, oil, salt, vanilla extract, and sugar in a blender or food processor and blend thoroughly.;2. Pour the mixture into a shallow bowl and dip in the slices of bread, ensuring they are fully coated.;3. Heat margarine or oil in a skillet over moderate heat and fry the dipped bread until browned on both sides.;4. Serve immediately with desired toppings.\",\"ingredients\":\"Soft or medium tofu: cup 1.5 , is_optional: ;Water: cup 1 , is_optional: ;Oil: tbsp 4 , is_optional: ;Salt: pinch 1 , is_optional: ;Vanilla extract: tsp 1 , is_optional: ;Sugar: tsp 3 , is_optional: ;Wholewheat bread: slice 8 , is_optional: ;Margarine or oil:   , is_optional: \",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c06f7d7-7ab55e51-51c8-4fc0-b6a3-3dbcfcfcd94c\",\"name\":\"Tofu Whipped Cream\",\"cooking_time\":20,\"servings\":4,\"instructions\":\"1. Rinse the tofu in cold water and press between several layers of paper or clean cloth towels to squeeze out all water possible.;2. Break the tofu into small pieces or mash it, and put it in a blender or food processor.;3. Add the remaining ingredients and blend.;4. Taste and adjust flavouring if desired, then blend again, if necessary.;5. Add optional thickener if desired.;6. Chill and serve.\",\"ingredients\":\"Tofu: oz 8 , is_optional: ;Maple syrup: tbsp 4 , is_optional: ;Vanilla: tsp 1 , is_optional: ;Arrowroot powder: tsp 2 , is_optional: is optional;Cinnamon: dash 1 , is_optional: is optional\",\"reference_count\":0},{\"id\":\"2c58cacf-fc8c-4159-8e78-be5833890323\",\"name\":\"Fried Egg and Tofu\",\"cooking_time\":12,\"servings\":3,\"instructions\":\"1. Press 300g firm tofu and cut into slices;2. Heat 2 tablespoons oil and pan-fry tofu until golden on both sides, about 6 minutes;3. Remove tofu and add 1 tablespoon oil;4. Fry 2 eggs sunn