9 p.m. on CBS\\n- *Watson* (Season 2) at 10 p.m. on CBS\\n\\n**Tuesday Nights**\\n- *NCIS* at 8 p.m. on CBS\\n- *Elsbeth* at 10 p.m. on CBS\\n- *Grey''s Anatomy* at 10 p.m. on ABC\\n\\n**Wednesday Nights**\\n- *Matlock* (Season 2) at 9 p.m. on CBS\\n\\n**Friday Nights**\\n- *Fire Country* (Season 4) at 9 p.m. on CBS\\n- *Boston Blue* at 10 p.m. on CBS\\n\\n**Sunday Nights**\\n- *Tracker* at 8 p.m. on CBS\\n- *The Road* at 9 p.m. on CBS\\n\\n## Variety and Game Shows\\n\\n**Late Night**\\n- *Jimmy Kimmel Live!* on ABC\\n- *Late Night with Seth Meyers* on NBC\\n\\n**Game Shows**\\n- *The Voice* at 8 p.m. on NBC (Tuesdays)\\n- *Dancing with the Stars* at 8 p.m. on ABC (Tuesdays)\\n\\nThe evening lineup currently features a strong mix of crime dramas and procedurals, along with reality competition shows and talk variety programs late in the evening.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"t5b7cC5N8XJqqVqb"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Oh, I can certainly help you find something great to watch! Based on the current schedule for November 2025, here are some options:\n\n**For Drama Lovers:**\n*   **Mondays:** You can catch *FBI* at 9 p.m. and *Watson* at 10 p.m. on CBS.\n*   **Tuesdays:** *NCIS* airs at 8 p.m. and *Elsbeth* at 10 p.m. on CBS, and *Grey''s Anatomy* is on ABC at 10 p.m.\n*   **Wednesdays:** *Matlock* (Season 2) is on CBS at 9 p.m.\n*   **Fridays:** Tune into *Fire Country* at 9 p.m. and *Boston Blue* at 10 p.m. on CBS.\n*   **Sundays:** *Tracker* is at 8 p.m. and *The Road* at 9 p.m. on CBS.\n\n**For Variety and Game Show Fun:**\n*   **Tuesdays:** *The Voice* airs at 8 p.m. on NBC, and *Dancing with the Stars* is on ABC at 8 p.m.\n*   For some late-night laughs, *Jimmy Kimmel Live!* is on ABC and *Late Night with Seth Meyers* is on NBC.\n\nI hope you find something you enjoy! Let me know if you''d like to explore other options!"}]}]',1764044838373,1764044838373,replace('-   **User''s core intent**: The user wants to find out about currently airing evening variety shows or dramas to watch.\n-   **Key actions made**: The AI provided a list of evening dramas and variety/game shows, including their air times and channels, based on the November 2025 schedule.\n-   **Current state**: The AI has offered several TV show options across different genres and days, and is awaiting the user''s response or further preferences.','\n',char(10)));
