erences?"}]}]',1764061798627,1764061798627,replace('**User''s core intent**: The user initially wanted spicy Chinese hot pot recipes for Amy''s celebration, but then shifted to recalling Amy''s specific food dislikes after being reminded about her aversion to spicy food.\n**Key actions made**: The AI identified Amy''s dislike for spicy food and egg allergy, then provided detailed egg-free recipes for both spicy and non-spicy hot pot broths, ingredients, and dipping sauce. The user subsequently asked what else Amy dislikes.\n**Current state**: The AI has reminded the user that Amy dislikes spicy food and broccoli, and has provided comprehensive hot pot recipes catering to these preferences and Amy''s egg allergy. The AI is awaiting further questions about family preferences.','\n',char(10)));
