"task_list_id":"e1671fb3-a4a9-4f8f-ac7f-60ed4dc5e180","name":"other","description":null},{"task_list_id":"1c149ac5-2027-409c-8cee-1f3f0eba294d","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"2aa82d71-b8c5-4730-a16d-53ea28207919","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9143c0d8-5875-4e60-9eac-61cc6f730d79","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"cf27c897-d9fa-4d62-816f-ce48cc09feae","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"a67192c3-a0ce-4f70-affb-cb26d2e0cfbb","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"37aaa6cd-a28e-477d-a940-9f69122c51b1","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"ec370438-0eaf-460b-8ba9-d085f12f0b28","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9cd41ac9-0828-418a-a16f-7cc58da185ff","name":"fdsf","description":null}]},"calendar":{"default_calendar":{"calendar_id":"f8b94cfc-9070-4814-849b-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Then draw a princess castle! She''ll definitely love it. And could you find me some cake recipes?"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A princess castle cake sounds absolutely magical for Amy! I''ll go ahead and search for some delicious cake recipes for you right away. Once I find some, I''ll share the details so you can choose the perfect one."},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"REwAQKMj3jGmNz9q","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"birthday cake recipes"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here are some popular and highly-rated birthday cake recipes from scratch, along with their key ingredients and tips for success:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. **Easy Birthday Cake (Rainbow Layer Cake)**\\n**Source:** [Southern Plate](https://www.southernplate.com/easy-birthday-cake-recipe-from-scratch/)\\n\\n**Ingredients:**\\n- 2 1/4 cups all-purpose flour\\n- 1 1/2 cups sugar\\n- 1/2 cup unsalted butter (room temperature)\\n- 3 tsp baking powder\\n- 1 tsp salt\\n- 1 tsp vanilla extract\\n- 1 1/2 cups milk\\n- 3 eggs\\n- Sprinkles (optional, for rainbow effect)\\n\\n**Buttercream Icing:**\\n- 2 sticks butter (room temperature)\\n- 4 tsp vanilla or butter flavoring\\n- 6 cups confectioners’ sugar\\n- 4–8 tbsp milk\\n\\n**Instructions:**\\n- Mix dry ingredients (flour, baking powder, salt).\\n- In another bowl, combine eggs, milk, and vanilla.\\n- Cream butter and sugar, then alternate adding dry and wet mixtures.\\n- Fold in sprinkles if desired.\\n- Divide batter between two pans, bake at 350°F for 30–35 minutes.\\n- Cool completely before frosting.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. **Classic Yellow Birthday Cake with Chocolate Frosting**\\n**Source:** [King Arthur Baking](https://www.kingarthurbaking.com/recipes/classic-birthday-cake-recipe)\\n\\n**Ingredients:**\\n- 2 cups all-purpose flour\\n- 1 1/4 tsp salt\\n- 2 tsp baking powder\\n- 4 large eggs (room temperature)\\n- 1 1/2 cups sugar\\n- 1 cup butter (room temperature)\\n- 1 cup milk\\n- 2 tsp vanilla extract\\n\\n**Chocolate Frosting:**\\n- Butter, powdered sugar, cocoa powder, milk, vanilla\\n\\n**Tips:**\\n- Room temperature ingredients ensure a smooth, fluffy texture.\\n- Bake at 350°F for 25–30 minutes.\\n- This cake is praised for its moist crumb and classic flavor.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. **Ultimate Birthday Cake (Allrecipes)**\\n**Source:** [Allrecipes Video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8sduuSCkIPk)\\n\\n**Ingredients:**\\n- Flour, baking powder, salt, sugar, eggs, milk, vanilla, butter, powdered sugar, sprinkles\\n\\n**Buttercream Frosting:**\\n- 1:1 ratio of butter to powdered sugar (fluffier, less sweet)\\n- 2 tbsp milk, 1 tbsp vanilla, pinch of salt\\n\\n**Tips:**\\n- Alternate adding dry ingredients and milk to the batter.\\n- Do not overmix—mix until just combined.\\n- Fill pans 2/3 full to avoid overflow.\\n- Bake at 350°F for 25–30 minutes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. **Modern Cake Recipes (Liv for Cake)**\\n**Source:** [Liv for Cake](https://livforcake.com)\\n\\n**Highlights:**\\n- Offers a variety of from-scratch cakes, including vanilla, chocolate, and unique flavors like Baileys & Guinness.\\n- Detailed tutorials and tips for perfect cakes.\\n- German buttercream (less sweet) and other creative frostings.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### General Tips for Birthday Cakes:\\n- Use room temperature ingredients for best texture.\\n- Alternate adding dry and wet ingredients to avoid overmixing.\\n- Fill pans 2/3 full to prevent overflow.\\n- Cool cakes completely before frosting.\\n- Customize with sprinkles, food coloring, or flavored frostings.\\n\\n---\\n\\nThese recipes are perfect for birthdays and can be easily customized with your favorite flavors and decorations.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"REwAQKMj3jGmNz9q"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That''s wonderful! Amy will adore a princess castle cake. ✨ I''ve found a few lovely cake recipes for you! They all seem quite delicious and suitable for a birthday celebration:\n\n1.  **Easy Birthday Cake (Rainbow Layer Cake)**: This one from Southern Plate sounds fun, especially if you want to add a splash of color! It uses basic ingredients like flour, sugar, butter, and milk, with a classic buttercream icing. Baking time is around 30-35 minutes.\n\n2.  **Classic Yellow Birthday Cake with Chocolate Frosting**: King Arthur Baking offers this recipe, known for its moist crumb and traditional flavor. It uses similar ingredients, and they emphasize using room temperature ingredients for the best texture. Baking time is about 25-30 minutes.\n\n3.  **Ultimate Birthday Cake (Allrecipes)**: This recipe focuses on ensuring a perfect texture by alternating dry and wet ingredients and avoiding overmixing. It also suggests a 1:1 ratio of butter to powdered sugar for the buttercream, which can be less sweet.\n\n4.  **Modern Cake Recipes (Liv for Cake)**: If you''re feeling adventurous, Liv for Cake has a variety of from-scratch options, including unique flavors and different frosting styles.\n\nAll of these can be customized, especially with sprinkles or food coloring, which would be perfect for a princess castle theme! Which one sounds like the perfect starting point for Amy''s special cake?"}]}]',1764063531469,1764063531469,replace('**User''s core intent**: The user wants to prepare a princess castle birthday cake for Amy and needs cake recipes for it.\n**Key actions made**: The user decided on a princess castle cake design and asked for cake recipes. The AI then found and presented multiple cake recipe options.\n**Current state**: The AI has provided four cake recipe options (Easy Birthday Cake, Classic Yellow Birthday Cake, Ultimate Birthday Cake, Modern Cake Recipes) and is awaiting the user''s selection.','\n',char(10)));
