le_nickname":"Linda","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"086366c2-7845-4412-b430-570fbd08196f","role_name":"Heisenberg (Grandparent)","user_id":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","role_nickname":"Heisenberg","birthday":"1985-03-15T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"0a3f2af0-999f-4d91-a035-3b2c0dbf373d","role_name":"David Wilson (Husband of Emily)","user_id":null,"role_nickname":"David","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"b80bab36-501f-4445-a667-f396ecdfd00f","role_name":"Michael Carter (Son of Robert & Linda)","user_id":null,"role_nickname":"Michael","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"}],"location":"上海市浦东新区陆家嘴金融中心","locale":"Asia/Shanghai"},"user_brief":{"task":{"task_lists":[{"task_list_id":"626726a9-fe42-4607-ae2d-3128d598bf6a","name":"hello","description":null},{"task_list_id":"8873bb27-0675-4952-afdc-b3ef6e59bc6e","name":"folder2","description":null},{"task_list_id":"f63a1c94-ec0c-4d72-ac74-4f463b3f747c","name":"知乎","description":null},{"task_list_id":"b1e379b7-7698-43af-8b5a-f71a4084ad39","name":"other","description":null},{"task_list_id":"e1671fb3-a4a9-4f8f-ac7f-60ed4dc5e180","name":"other","description":null},{"task_list_id":"1c149ac5-2027-409c-8cee-1f3f0eba294d","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"2aa82d71-b8c5-4730-a16d-53ea28207919","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9143c0d8-5875-4e60-9eac-61cc6f730d79","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"cf27c897-d9fa-4d62-816f-ce48cc09feae","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"a67192c3-a0ce-4f70-affb-cb26d2e0cfbb","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"37aaa6cd-a28e-477d-a940-9f69122c51b1","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"ec370438-0eaf-460b-8ba9-d085f12f0b28","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9cd41ac9-0828-418a-a16f-7cc58da185ff","name":"fdsf","description":null}]},"calendar":{"default_calendar":{"calendar_id":"f8b94cfc-9070-4814-849b-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Give me a seafood set menu recipe"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I''d love to help you create a seafood set menu! 🍤 Let me search for some delicious seafood recipes that would work well together as a complete menu."},{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"toolu_01QKRV5aoLjE9He2tm15XQwX","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"seafood set menu recipes complete dinner"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here is a **complete seafood set menu** featuring appetizers, main courses, sides, and dessert, inspired by top seafood dinner party and date night recipes. This menu is perfect for hosting a special dinner or creating a gourmet seafood experience at home.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### **Seafood Set Menu: Complete Dinner**\\n\\n#### **Appetizers**\\n1. **Bacon-Wrapped Scallops with Spicy Cilantro-Mayonnaise**  \\n   Tender scallops wrapped in bacon, grilled to perfection, and served with a zesty cilantro-mayo dip.\\n\\n2. **Smoked Salmon Deviled Eggs**  \\n   Classic deviled eggs with a twist—topped with smoked salmon for a rich, savory bite.\\n\\n3. **Hot Crab and Artichoke Dip**  \\n   Creamy, cheesy dip with lump crab meat and artichoke hearts, served warm with crusty bread or crackers.\\n\\n4. **Shrimp Ceviche**  \\n   Fresh shrimp marinated in citrus juices, mixed with tomatoes, onions, cilantro, and avocado.\\n\\n---\\n\\n#### **Main Courses**\\n1. **Baked Salmon with Creamy Coconut-Ginger Sauce**  \\n   Flaky salmon fillets baked and topped with a creamy, aromatic coconut-ginger sauce.\\n\\n2. **Tequila-Lime Shrimp Tacos with Chipotle Cream**  \\n   Grilled shrimp tacos with a tangy tequila-lime marinade, served with chipotle cream and fresh toppings.\\n\\n3. **Seafood Gumbo (Chicken, Shrimp, and Sausage)**  \\n   A hearty, flavorful one-pot stew with shrimp, chicken, sausage, and vegetables, simmered in a savory roux.\\n\\n4. **Seared Salmon with Mediterranean Vegetables**  \\n   Pan-seared salmon served with olives, capers, and seasonal vegetables for a light, elegant dish.\\n\\n---\\n\\n#### **Side Dishes**\\n- **Coconut-Ginger Rice**  \\n  Fragrant rice cooked with coconut milk and fresh ginger.\\n\\n- **Summer Gratin**  \\n  A creamy vegetable gratin with seasonal produce.\\n\\n- **Simple Steamed Mussels with Garlic**  \\n  Mussels steamed in garlic, white wine, and herbs.\\n\\n---\\n\\n#### **Dessert**\\n- **Key Lime Pie**  \\n  A classic, tangy-sweet pie with a graham cracker crust and fluffy key lime filling.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### **Beverage Suggestion**\\n- **Sea Breeze Cocktail**  \\n  A refreshing mix of vodka, cranberry juice, and grapefruit juice.\\n\\n---\\n\\nThis menu offers a variety of seafood flavors and textures, from rich and creamy to light and citrusy, ensuring a memorable and satisfying dinner experience.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"toolu_01QKRV5aoLjE9He2tm15XQwX"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Here''s a wonderful **Seafood Set Menu** for you! 🦐✨\n\n## **🍽️ Complete Seafood Dinner Menu**\n\n### **Appetizers** (Choose 1-2)\n1. **Bacon-Wrapped Scallops** with spicy cilantro-mayo\n2. **Smoked Salmon Deviled Eggs** - elegant and rich\n3. **Hot Crab and Artichoke Dip** - creamy and indulgent\n4. **Shrimp Ceviche** - fresh and citrusy\n\n### **Main Courses** (Choose 1)\n1. **Baked Salmon with Coconut-Ginger Sauce** - creamy and aromatic\n2. **Tequila-Lime Shrimp Tacos** - fun and flavorful\n3. **Seafood Gumbo** - hearty and warming\n4. **Seared Salmon with Mediterranean Vegetables** - light and elegant\n\n### **Side Dishes**\n- Coconut-Ginger Rice\n- Summer Gratin with seasonal vegetables\n- Simple Steamed Mussels with Garlic\n\n### **Dessert**\n- Key Lime Pie - the perfect citrusy finish! 🥧\n\n---\n\n**However, I noticed some family members have dietary considerations I should mention:**\n- 🚫 **Heisenberg** dislikes shellfish (so skip shrimp/scallops/crab dishes for him)\n- 🚫 **Sarah** dislikes mushrooms and olives (and is allergic to tree nuts)\n- 🚫 **Noah** is allergic to dairy\n\nWould you like me to:\n1. **Create individual recipes** from this menu for you?\n2. **Adapt it** for specific family members with their dietary needs?\n3. **Focus on one main course** and build a complete recipe around it?\n\nJust let me know! 😊"}]}]',1764681003603,1764681003603,replace('- **User''s core intent**: The user wants a seafood set menu recipe.\n- **Key actions made**: The AI generated and presented a comprehensive seafood set menu with appetizers, main courses, sides, and dessert, using information from a tool.\n- **Current state**: A seafood set menu has been provided, along with noted dietary restrictions for specific family members (Heisenberg: dislikes shellfish; Sarah: dislikes mushrooms/olives, allergic to tree nuts; Noah: allergic to dairy). The AI is now offering to create individual recipes, adapt the menu for dietary needs, or focus on one main course.','\n',char(10)));
