-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What can I make with chicken breast, broccoli, and rice?"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"toolu_012fXA1KYw581jyVuZYZQxp2","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"recipes with chicken breast broccoli rice"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"Here are several delicious recipes that combine chicken breast, broccoli, and rice, all designed for easy weeknight dinners and minimal cleanup:\\n\\n### 1. Cheesy Chicken Broccoli Rice Casserole (The Cozy Cook)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, white rice, chicken broth, cream of chicken soup, milk, sour cream, cheddar cheese.\\n- **Method:** Sear chicken, cook rice and broccoli in broth, mix with creamy soup and cheese, then bake until bubbly.\\n- **Key Feature:** Comforting, cheesy, and uses pantry staples.\\n\\n### 2. One-Pan Cheesy Chicken, Broccoli, and Rice (The Girl Who Ate Everything)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, white rice, chicken broth, onion, garlic, cheddar cheese.\\n- **Method:** Sauté chicken and onion, add rice and broth, simmer, add broccoli, finish with cheese.\\n- **Key Feature:** Ready in under 30 minutes, one pan, minimal cleanup.\\n\\n### 3. Skillet Chicken and Rice with Broccoli (Family Style Food)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, arborio or short grain rice, chicken broth, milk, Parmesan cheese, onion, garlic.\\n- **Method:** Brown chicken, add broth, milk, rice, broccoli, and cheese, then bake until rice is tender.\\n- **Key Feature:** Creamy texture, Parmesan cheese, oven-to-table dish.\\n\\n### 4. One Pan Creamy Chicken & Broccoli Rice (Raising Generation Nourished)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, white rice, coconut milk or whole milk, bone broth, nutritional yeast or cheese, onion, garlic.\\n- **Method:** Sear chicken, add creamy sauce and rice, simmer, add broccoli last for crisp-tender texture.\\n- **Key Feature:** Creamy, customizable, ready in under 30 minutes.\\n\\n### 5. Cheesy Chicken Broccoli Rice Skillet (Chocolate Moosey)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, white rice, onion, carrot, chicken broth.\\n- **Method:** Sauté chicken and veggies, add rice and broth, simmer until rice is cooked.\\n- **Key Feature:** Includes carrots for extra veggies, one-pan meal.\\n\\n### 6. One-Pan Honey Garlic Chicken Broccoli Rice (Hungry Happens)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, basmati rice, chicken broth, onion, garlic, honey, soy sauce, Sriracha.\\n- **Method:** Marinate chicken, sauté with onion and garlic, add broccoli, rice, and broth, simmer until done.\\n- **Key Feature:** Sweet and savory, Asian-inspired flavors.\\n\\n### 7. Quick One-Pan Chicken & Broccoli Rice (YouTube)\\n- **Ingredients:** Chicken breast, broccoli, rice, chicken broth, onion, garlic.\\n- **Method:** Sauté chicken, add rice and broth, simmer, add broccoli, cook until tender.\\n- **Key Feature:** Fast, customizable, healthy, and hearty.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Common Themes:**\\n- Most recipes use boneless, skinless chicken breast, fresh broccoli florets, and white rice.\\n- Cooking methods typically involve sautéing chicken, simmering rice and broccoli in broth, and finishing with cheese or a creamy sauce.\\n- All recipes are designed for one-pan or one-dish convenience, making cleanup easy.\\n\\nThese recipes are perfect for busy weeknights and can be easily customized with your favorite seasonings or additional vegetables.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"toolu_012fXA1KYw581jyVuZYZQxp2"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Great question! You''ve got the perfect combo for some delicious one-pan meals! 😊 Here are some wonderful options:\n\n**Top Picks:**\n\n1. **Cheesy Chicken Broccoli Rice Casserole** - A cozy, comforting classic! Sear your chicken, mix it with rice, broccoli, and a creamy cheese sauce, then bake until bubbly. Perfect comfort food!\n\n2. **One-Pan Creamy Chicken & Broccoli Rice** - Ready in under 30 minutes! Sauté the chicken, then add rice and broth to the same pan, simmer, and add broccoli at the end so it stays nice and crisp.\n\n3. **Honey Garlic Chicken Broccoli Rice** - If you want something with Asian-inspired flavors, try this sweet and savory version with soy sauce, garlic, and a touch of honey.\n\n4. **Simple Skillet Version** - The easiest route: brown your chicken, add broth and rice, let it simmer, then toss in the broccoli. Finish with a bit of cheese or your favorite seasoning.\n\n**Why these work so well:** They''re all one-pan or one-dish meals, which means minimal cleanup, and the chicken stays tender while the rice absorbs all those delicious flavors.\n\nWould you like me to create a detailed recipe for any of these? I can also adjust them based on your family''s food preferences! 🍗✨"}]}]',1764730928250,1764730928250,replace('- **User''s core intent**: The user wants recipe ideas for meals using chicken breast, broccoli, and rice.\n- **Key actions made**: The AI provided four distinct one-pan/one-dish recipe options: Cheesy Casserole, One-Pan Creamy, Honey Garlic, and a Simple Skillet version.\n- **Current state**: The AI has offered several recipe options and is awaiting the user''s choice to provide a detailed recipe or customize further.','\n',char(10)));
