","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fruit Yogurt is wonderful !I''m going to eat it today, tomorrow, and the day after tomorrow!"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That''s so wonderful! 🎉 I love your enthusiasm! Fruit and yogurt is such a healthy choice - your teeth will thank you, and it tastes delicious! 😋\n\nSo you want it for three days in a row: today (Wednesday, December 3rd), tomorrow (Thursday, December 4th), and the day after tomorrow (Friday, December 5th). That''s awesome! \n\nBefore I add it to your meal plan, I just need a quick question: **What time would you like to have your fruit yogurt each day - at Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, or as a Snack?**\n\nOnce you let me know, I''ll get it all set up for you! ✨"}]}]',1764733665395,1764733665395,replace('**User''s core intent**: The user initially wanted the AI to secretly add candy to their dinner, but after AI''s guidance, shifted to wanting a mom-approved, tooth-friendly dessert.\n**Key actions made**: The AI advised against sneaking dessert and proposed alternatives like fruit with yogurt. The user chose fruit yogurt for three consecutive days.\n**Current state**: The AI has confirmed the user''s choice of fruit yogurt for three days and is awaiting information on the preferred time of day (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, or Snack) to add it to the meal plan.','\n',char(10)));
