ull,"role_nickname":"Linda","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"086366c2-7845-4412-b430-570fbd08196f","role_name":"Heisenberg (Grandparent)","user_id":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","role_nickname":"Heisenberg","birthday":"1985-03-15T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"0a3f2af0-999f-4d91-a035-3b2c0dbf373d","role_name":"David Wilson (Husband of Emily)","user_id":null,"role_nickname":"David","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"},{"family_role_id":"b80bab36-501f-4445-a667-f396ecdfd00f","role_name":"Michael Carter (Son of Robert & Linda)","user_id":null,"role_nickname":"Michael","birthday":"2025-09-23T00:00:00Z"}],"location":"上海市浦东新区陆家嘴金融中心","locale":"Asia/Shanghai"},"user_brief":{"task":{"task_lists":[{"task_list_id":"626726a9-fe42-4607-ae2d-3128d598bf6a","name":"hello","description":null},{"task_list_id":"8873bb27-0675-4952-afdc-b3ef6e59bc6e","name":"folder2","description":null},{"task_list_id":"f63a1c94-ec0c-4d72-ac74-4f463b3f747c","name":"知乎","description":null},{"task_list_id":"b1e379b7-7698-43af-8b5a-f71a4084ad39","name":"other","description":null},{"task_list_id":"e1671fb3-a4a9-4f8f-ac7f-60ed4dc5e180","name":"other","description":null},{"task_list_id":"1c149ac5-2027-409c-8cee-1f3f0eba294d","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"2aa82d71-b8c5-4730-a16d-53ea28207919","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9143c0d8-5875-4e60-9eac-61cc6f730d79","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"cf27c897-d9fa-4d62-816f-ce48cc09feae","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"a67192c3-a0ce-4f70-affb-cb26d2e0cfbb","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"37aaa6cd-a28e-477d-a940-9f69122c51b1","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"ec370438-0eaf-460b-8ba9-d085f12f0b28","name":"fdsf","description":null},{"task_list_id":"9cd41ac9-0828-418a-a16f-7cc58da185ff","name":"fdsf","description":null}]},"calendar":{"default_calendar":{"calendar_id":"f8b94cfc-9070-4814-849b-02cb0d050764","name":"Family Calendar","description":null}}},"chat_info":{"conversation_id":"89ffae50-7ee6-49af-ba4b-35ceb6a3f5f8","turn_id":"9348ee45-7512-4943-81bc-dbbb3a53923a","user_ui_message_id":"cde621ab-e707-4b5d-9ac4-8de66bd11478","assistant_ui_message_id":"cc5a8f76-21e1-4557-8266-180017d32573"}}','{"X-Family-ID":"09a097f6-d708-49e4-8ccf-a78cab898ba0","X-Timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","X-User-ID":"a7a2dfb9-0995-489a-929e-88be06e1bf2f","TraceId":"dsafsdfasdf"}','[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How long does it take to do Mapo Tofu？"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_call","tool_call":{"id":"toolu_019eYMmV7rHBQDS44ZCBGvf6","name":"system_intelligentSearch","arguments":{"query":"Mapo Tofu cooking time how long to make"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_result":{"name":"system_intelligentSearch","content":"{\"search_summary\":\"The typical **cooking time to make Mapo Tofu ranges from about 15 to 30 minutes**, depending on the recipe and steps involved.\\n\\nKey time details from various recipes:\\n\\n- **Sautéing tofu** in a skillet usually takes about **6 to 8 minutes** to get lightly crispy edges.\\n\\n- Bringing the sauce to a simmer and cooking tofu with the sauce generally takes around **3 to 5 minutes** to heat through and thicken the sauce.\\n\\n- One recipe simmers the tofu and sauce covered over medium-low heat for about **8 to 10 minutes** until the sauce is reduced.\\n\\n- Other quick recipes have a total active cook time of about **15 minutes**, including cooking ground meat and stirring in tofu until heated through.\\n\\n- For blanching soft tofu prior to cooking, it''s sometimes boiled briefly for **2 minutes** before simmering with sauce.\\n\\nOverall, most home recipes for Mapo Tofu include:\\n\\n1. Preparing aromatics and meat (~3-5 minutes)\\n\\n2. Cooking tofu cubes separately or adding them directly (~2-8 minutes)\\n\\n3. Simmering tofu in sauce to thicken (~3-10 minutes)\\n\\n**Total cook time commonly falls between 15 and 30 minutes**, with 20 minutes being a good average estimate for a straightforward Mapo Tofu preparation at home.\\n\\nThus, if you want to make Mapo Tofu, plan for about 15-30 minutes of cook time depending on your approach, ingredient choices, and desired tofu texture.\"}","success":true,"tool_call_id":"toolu_019eYMmV7rHBQDS44ZCBGvf6"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Great question! **Mapo Tofu typically takes 15-30 minutes** to prepare, with **20 minutes being a good average**. ⏱️\n\nHere''s the breakdown:\n- **Prep aromatics & meat**: 3-5 minutes\n- **Cook tofu separately** (if sautéing): 6-8 minutes  \n- **Simmer in sauce**: 3-10 minutes to let flavors blend and sauce thicken\n\n**For a quicker 15-minute version**: You can skip the pre-sautéing step and add tofu directly to the sauce, which cuts down the time significantly.\n\nSo it definitely fits into your 15-minute dinner goal if you use a streamlined approach! 😊 Would you like me to find a specific quick recipe or create one for your family?"}]}]',1764734474579,1764734474579,replace('-   **User''s core intent**: The user initially wanted 15-minute Asian-inspired dinner ideas, then specifically inquired about the preparation time for Mapo Tofu to confirm it fits the time constraint.\n-   **Key actions made**: The AI provided a list of 8 15-minute Asian-inspired dinner options and then clarified that Mapo Tofu typically takes 15-30 minutes, outlining how to achieve a 15-minute version.\n-   **Current state**: The AI has confirmed Mapo Tofu''s cooking time and is now offering to provide a specific recipe or create one for the user.','\n',char(10)));
