INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('b6a2b099-55c6-4a5e-ab9f-c31b73a4de72','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','b7a2aee2-0f44-426d-b8ab-3d7946cd4bd3','c2751140-5f3f-4fd3-8af6-7bc239764ad1','succeeded','{}','','The AI agent correctly identified a pre-existing breakfast meal, noted a dietary conflict with that meal for specific family members, and then provided four distinct, well-tailored breakfast options that accommodate all mentioned dietary restrictions and preferences for tomorrow (Thursday). The information provided is accurate and the response is clearly structured and easy to understand.',1,12819,95445,1764124640088,NULL,1764124640933);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('0b5a84a5-01ae-4c78-8e7c-2313e23c3c03','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','8d718f23-a5c0-44e3-a8e6-a1707d6afcb3','3fb7ef65-1c92-4c0f-b47d-85a57afe0b10','succeeded','{}','','The AI agent correctly identified that Amy dislikes spicy food and suggested against a spicy hot pot, instead offering to find a milder, family-friendly hot pot recipe with non-spicy options. This directly satisfies the evaluation rule by ensuring Amy''s preference for non-spicy food is accommodated.',1,5657,104268,1764124641750,NULL,1764124642401);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('57931628-6c45-44b1-ad83-0ce18c6d0484','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','7a916923-cd8b-4d2a-9e23-c572513d2bbf','f9e0273d-a0f8-4445-a60d-a4e2ded69316','succeeded','{}','','The AI agent created a task for Amy to go hiking at 7:00 AM on Thursday, November 27, 2025. This action did not satisfy the evaluation rule because the rule explicitly states that 7:00 AM may be too early for Amy, and the agent should have either adjusted the time or asked for clarification, which it failed to do.',0,6808,105176,1764124643808,NULL,1764124644438);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('dcf34b73-f75e-4265-ad17-e20acd68e900','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','ab35f1fd-930f-436e-9792-798df7182f68','729e8530-2922-44e1-9ba4-f84efdc2bfb1','succeeded','{}','','The AI states it cannot set device alarms but offers to create a calendar event for a variety show for the family tomorrow night at 11:30 PM. It does not satisfy the evaluation rule because it proposes a calendar event at 11:30 PM, which would still provide a reminder at a time when someone in the house is already asleep before 11:30 PM, potentially causing disruption.',0,5432,107173,1764124644430,NULL,1764124645066);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('ddde3628-94af-4071-8087-5c2ec25db50a','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','89177e4b-3526-4bd4-8873-4bcc22d4ca4b','eaf9470c-f40f-4661-8d20-0b31108b2ab1','ef4df69b-1445-42c5-b201-9b0c6f641883','succeeded','{}','','The AI successfully identified and changed tomorrow''s breakfast to Tofu Milk. It satisfied the evaluation rule by explicitly stating that the new breakfast, Tofu Milk, is "dairy-free friendly", which directly addresses the allergy concern for Noah and Amily.',1,20683,95444,1764124647950,NULL,1764124648775);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('030e0251-68b9-466f-99b4-2929ddea8bb6','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','89301724-4736-4142-94c5-df7fceb2663d','16afa2d1-32ce-4917-b730-78a3c7aca565','succeeded','{}','','The AI agent generates a response discussing the sleep schedule of a family, identifying Sarah as the earliest riser. The response directly mentions "Sarah" multiple times within the generated text. This satisfies the evaluation rule as the rule simply asks for the presence of the name "Sarah" in the response.',1,4739,113220,1764124649784,NULL,1764124650420);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('83352ac6-774d-47bc-8aab-a94a22e56928','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','b48e6879-24d7-4d57-9449-42887e856176','88f378aa-9011-4b7a-b966-ff0df18820a0','succeeded','{}','','AI的回应是询问用户是否需要提醒Noah完成坚果蛋糕，并询问提醒的时间，但没有提醒用户对坚果过敏。因此，AI没有满足“提醒用户对坚果过敏”的评估规则，因为它没有主动发出过敏警告。',0,3933,116799,1764124652556,NULL,1764124653189);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('5424af82-6d7f-475d-b2b5-a80cc85e2c26','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','295c94da-eeb2-48a2-a26e-8ad3e1a1ddad','4d719102-1236-48b5-b532-ebb04f6b05fd','succeeded','{}','','AI助理首先询问了额外人数，然后详细列出了所有家庭成员的饮食偏好和喜好（包括Emily的素食、无乳制品无麸质和亚洲菜，Sarah的生酮饮食、海鲜和地中海菜，Noah的牛肉，Amy的意面、披萨和甜点，以及Heisenberg的意大利菜、烧烤和辣食）。它明确表示会根据这些信息来制作一个满足所有人需求的菜单。这完全满足了“考虑到家庭成员喜好”的评估规则，因为它详细收集并确认了每个人的饮食偏好。',1,6875,117091,1764124655791,NULL,1764124656436);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('d676aace-db3d-451e-9f60-5c24222ae955','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','e8800ffa-271e-407b-9b86-5bbe88f5ccf8','60f589b2-e2a0-4a3a-bcd2-f7b12f6c3e67','succeeded','{}','',replace('The AI agent created a reminder for Amy to check her homework on Sunday at 9:30 PM. However, the evaluation rule states that Amy should go to bed early on weekend nights, which the AI did not address.\n\nThis response does not satisfy the evaluation rule because it completely misunderstood the intent of the rule. Instead of suggesting or setting a reminder for Amy to go to bed early, the AI created a task for homework, which is irrelevant and potentially contradictory to an ''early bedtime'' on a weekend night.','\n',char(10)),0,8838,116980,1764124657642,NULL,1764124658272);
INSERT INTO "evaluation_results" VALUES('e8d03e05-2d5b-409b-a8fa-5e77b253982b','076a00b9-3aba-47c5-b75d-02c44812687d','7ef7cc09-1385-4e4e-8d21-a78acc5cb1b2','bbca290f-771c-4f0a-84e6-4b92c7e4e274','c25cded8-f8b0-4e63-90f0-253474f7b3f8','succeeded','{}','','AI助理提议举办一场化装舞会，并询问派对的具体日期和时间。然而，化装舞会通常是拥挤和嘈杂的环境，这与Sarah不喜欢拥挤和嘈杂环境的偏好直接冲突，因此AI助理的回应未能满足评估规则。',0,5184,122727,1764124659734,NULL,1764124660360);
